@startuml MyBattleship_UseCase_Battle
title MyBattleship - Use Case Detail: Battle and Abilities

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F5F9FF
  BorderColor #33567F
}

actor Attacker
actor "Timer\n<<system clock>>" as Timer
actor Defender

rectangle "MyBattleship System" {
  usecase "Use Ability" as UC_Ability
  usecase "Fire Shot" as UC_Fire
  usecase "Auto-fire on Timeout" as UC_Auto
  usecase "Resolve Shot" as UC_Resolve
  usecase "Sink Ship" as UC_Sink
  usecase "Declare Winner" as UC_Win
  usecase "Draw Ability" as UC_Draw
  usecase "Keep or Replace Ability" as UC_Keep

  usecase "Radar Sweep" as UC_Radar
  usecase "Line Scan" as UC_Line
  usecase "Double Shot" as UC_Double
  usecase "Reroute" as UC_Reroute
}

Attacker --> UC_Fire
Attacker --> UC_Ability
Timer --> UC_Auto
Defender --> UC_Keep

UC_Ability .> UC_Fire : <<extend>>
UC_Auto .> UC_Fire : <<include>>
UC_Fire ..> UC_Resolve : <<include>>
UC_Sink ..> UC_Resolve : <<extend>>
UC_Win ..> UC_Resolve : <<extend>>
UC_Sink ..> UC_Draw : <<include>>
UC_Keep ..> UC_Draw : <<extend>>

UC_Ability <|-- UC_Radar
UC_Ability <|-- UC_Line
UC_Ability <|-- UC_Double
UC_Ability <|-- UC_Reroute

note top of Attacker
  Attacker and Defender are
  roles of Player; they swap
  as turns pass.
end note

note bottom of UC_Sink
  Condition: shot hit the last
  undamaged cell of a ship (Scenario 4).
end note

note bottom of UC_Draw
  Ability goes to the owner of the sunk
  ship. Reroute is redrawn if no
  undamaged ship can move.
end note

note bottom of UC_Keep
  Condition: Defender already
  holds an ability (Scenario 5).
end note

note bottom of UC_Win
  Condition: every opposing
  ship is sunk (BR-10, Scenario 7).
end note

note right of UC_Fire
  An already-targeted cell can't be
  selected, so no shot is sent (BR-09,
  Scenario 8); re-checked on server (SEC-02).
end note

@enduml